# Real, third-party schema files fetched verbatim from an external source
# (`tools/schema-verifier/thirdparty/upstream/`'s own header comments each
# cite the exact URL) — these must stay byte-identical to what was
# actually fetched, since their whole evidentiary value is "this is really
# what the upstream repository publishes," not "this is what our own
# formatter would have chosen." Most extensions there (`.fga`, `.zed`)
# have no built-in Prettier parser and were already silently skipped; this
# entry covers the two that do (`.yaml`, `.mdx`) and would otherwise be
# silently reformatted by a plain `npm run format` — caught live via
# `npm run format:check` flagging them, not assumed.
tools/schema-verifier/thirdparty/upstream/
